<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.04 pct, 3-mo 21.91 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.04 pct, 3-mo 21.91 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was unchanged for the one-month maturity on Friday, while the rate eased slightly for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.04 percent. The three-month rate was fixed at 21.91 percent, down from 21.94 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
